  "zh": "# 今日AI与科技热点：机器手降价、特斯拉飞车暗示及OpenAI模型突破引领行业关注\n## AI 与科技\n- **OpenAI新模型解决100+开放问题**：模型在多个基准上实现突破，显示推理能力提升。\n- **Grok 4.7前端能力测试**：最新版在代码生成和理解上显著领先同类模型。\n- **AI在哥德巴赫猜想上有何新进展**：研究利用大模型辅助数学证明，提供新思路。\n## 产品发布\n- **宇树Dex5-S灵巧手发布 3.99万元起**：高精度机械手降价发布，推动工业与服务机器人普及。\n- **特斯拉新车能飞？发布会设临时禁飞区**：特斯拉暗示垂直起降能力，引发行业对未来出行形态的猜测。\n- **苹果高管希望不要给iPhone贴膜**：官方建议减少贴膜以保证触感和散热，反映对用户体验的关注。\n## 行业动向\n- **雷军回应“打新宇树赚了100多亿”**：雷军确认小米早期投资宇树获利巨额，显示产业布局成功。\n- **NASA的火星样本返回任务宣告失败**：任务因预算和技术问题被叫停，影响深空探测计划。",
  "en": "# Today's AI & Tech Highlights: Robot hand price cut, Tesla hints at flight, OpenAI model breakthrough leads industry attention\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI new model solves 100+ open problems**: The model achieves breakthroughs on multiple benchmarks, showing improved reasoning ability.\n- **Grok 4.7 frontend capability test**: The latest version significantly leads peers in code generation and comprehension.\n- **AI progress on Goldbach conjecture**: Researchers use large models to assist mathematical proof, offering new insights.\n## Product Launches\n- **Unitree Dex5-S dexterous hand launches at 39,900 yuan**: The high-precision robotic hand is released at a lower price, driving adoption in industrial and service robotics.\n- **Tesla hints at flying car with temporary no‑fly zone at launch**: Tesla suggests vertical take‑off capability, sparking speculation about future mobility.\n- **Apple exec advises against iPhone screen protectors**: Official recommendation to avoid protectors to preserve touch feel and heat dissipation, reflecting focus on user experience.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Lei Jun responds to profit from early Unitree investment**: Lei Jun confirms Xiaomi’s early stake in Unitree yielded huge returns, showing successful industry positioning.\n- **NASA’s Mars Sample Return mission declared dead**: The mission was halted due to budget and technical issues, affecting deep‑space exploration plans."
